  "tuning_objective_J": "info_ratio - 1.0*starvation_rate - 0.5*stale_rate - 0.5*max(silent_excess,0) - 0.25*max(lowinfo_excess,0); mean over TRAIN scenarios x seeds",
  "selection_rule": "top-3 configs by TRAIN J are re-scored on VALIDATION; the config with the highest VALIDATION J is frozen. Ties (|dJ|<0.005) -> the config nearer the centre of the search grid. Held-out data are never read.",
